       "source": "PubMed",
       "id": "8104875"
      }
     ],
     "value": "Expressed in fibroblasts, heart, skeletal muscle, brain and pancreas. Expressed at an intermediate level in lung and kidney, and at a low level in liver and placenta. Expressed at a lower level in fibroblasts from hypertrophic scar lesional skin and in fibroblasts from patients with systemic sclerosis than in normal skin fibroblasts"
    }
   ],
   "commentType": "TISSUE SPECIFICITY"
